# Drop salon photos here

Place your real salon photos at the following paths:
- /public/photos/salon-1.jpg  → used in the Hero section
- /public/photos/salon-2.jpg  → used in the About section
- /public/photos/salon-3.jpg  → optional secondary About image

Recommended size: 1600×2000 (4:5) JPG/WebP, < 400 KB each.
Until these files exist, the site uses Unsplash fallbacks defined in
src/config/site.ts (photos.fallback.*).
